╭─ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Everywhere                                                   Calendar list                                           │
│ 0                 Calendar list                              j k  g G          Move                                  │
│ 1 2 3             Agenda, week, month                        space             Show or hide a calendar, or an account│
│ tab               Switch between the list and the view       enter             Fold or unfold an account             │
│ t                 Today                                      n                 Rename a calendar or account          │
│ r                 Sync now (also every 5 minutes)            d                 Remove a calendar (asks first)        │
│ a                 Add a calendar: iCal link or Google        s                 Sign a Google account in again (⚠)    │
│ ?                 This help                                  c                 Collapse or expand the list           │
│ q  ctrl+c         Quit                                       l  →              Back to the view                      │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ Agenda                                                       Event details                                           │
│ j k  ↓ ↑          Next, previous event                       j k  ↓ ↑          Select a link, or scroll without links│
│ g G               First, last event                          1–9               Select a link by number               │
│ [ ]  pgup pgdn    Previous, next day                         enter  o          Open the link in the browser          │
│ enter             Event details                                                The full address shows before opening │
│                   Moving past the end loads more days        pgup pgdn  space  Scroll                                │
│                                                              esc  q            Close                                 │
│ Week                                                                                                                 │
│ h l  ← →          Previous, next day                         Popups                                                  │
│ j k  ↓ ↑          Next, previous event of the day            tab  ↓ ↑          Next, previous field or choice        │
│ g G               First, last event of the day               enter             Next field, or confirm                │
│ [ ]  pgup pgdn    Previous, next week                        esc               Cancel                                │
│ enter             Event details                              space             Tick a calendar (Google picker)       │
│                                                              o                 Open the Google sign-in page again    │
│ Month                                                        r  c              Retry sign-in, change the OAuth client│
│ h l  ← →          Previous, next day                         y n               Remove, keep (remove popup)           │
│ j k  ↓ ↑          Next, previous week                                          Pasting works in every text field     │
│ g G               First, last day of the month                                                                       │
│ [ ]  pgup pgdn    Previous, next month                       Status line                                             │
│ enter             Open the day in the agenda                 left              Activity: working, synced, failed     │
│                                                              right             Last sync, or a failure and its retry │
│                                                              ⚠                 Account needs signing in again        │
